OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry start to the day this
OL,6,Fmorning with some brightness. Then
OL,7,Fclouding over with scattered showers
OL,8,Fbreaking out through the afternoon.
OL,9,FFeeling rather cool.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FAny showers will gradually
OL,12,Fdie out this evening. Then the rest of
OL,13,Fthe night will be dry across all parts
OL,14,Fwith clear periods. Becoming chilly
OL,15,Facross Deeside.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA dry morning with sunny
OL,18,Fspells. Becoming cloudier in the
OL,19,Fafternoon with a few light showers,
OL,20,Fthese mainly in the west and north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
