OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMainly
OL,6,Fdry and bright on Sunday. Becoming
OL,7,Funsettled on Monday and Tuesday,
OL,8,Fperhaps heavy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
